<p style="font-size:11px;color:#889;margin-top:12px">Data tersimpan otomatis di browser ini. Butuh internet untuk font dan fitur unduh.</p>
</aside>
<main><button id="big">Perbesar</button><div id="holder"><div id="wrap"><div id="post">
<div class="f1"></div><div class="f2"></div>
<div class="pill"><img class="b" src="data:image/png;base64,"><i></i><img class="y" id="pYys" src="data:image/png;base64,"></div>
